                    <h1>🔄 Lesson 30: Retopology Fundamentals</h1>
                    <p class="lead">Transform high-resolution sculpts and messy geometry into clean, production-ready meshes. Learn retopology techniques that bridge the gap between artistic freedom and technical requirements—essential for animation, games, and professional pipelines.</p>
                </header>

